<?xml version="1.0"?>
<info xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
	  xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="https://apps.nextcloud.com/schema/apps/info.xsd">
	<id>nldesign</id>
	<name>NL Design System Theme</name>
	<summary>Apply Dutch government design tokens (NL Design System) to Nextcloud</summary>
	<description><![CDATA[
This app allows you to apply NL Design System design tokens to your Nextcloud instance.

It ships 43 token sets covering the Dutch national government (Rijkshuisstijl), the
large-city design systems (Utrecht, Amsterdam, Den Haag, Rotterdam), a broad set of
community-maintained municipality and organization brands, and La Suite numérique
(Cunningham design system) for European sovereign-workplace (MinBZK/mijn-bureau EDIC)
bundles. Configure which token set to use in the admin settings.

Fira Sans and Inter (both SIL Open Font License 1.1) are bundled and self-hosted — no
external CDN — so the theme works inside Nextcloud's default Content-Security-Policy and
on air-gapped government instances.

Free and open source under the EUPL-1.2 license.
Gratis en open source onder de EUPL-1.2 licentie.
	]]></description>
	<version>0.1.3-unstable.17</version>
	<licence>EUPL-1.2</licence>
	<author mail="info@conduction.nl" homepage="https://www.conduction.nl/">Conduction</author>
	<namespace>NLDesign</namespace>
	<category>customization</category>
	<website>https://codeberg.org/Conduction/nldesign</website>
